      storyTitleArabic: "حالة طارئة في العمل",
      paragraphs: <String>["While the office team was preparing a delivery, a smoke alarm sounded. Layla followed the evacuation plan and directed visitors towards the nearest marked exit without collecting her belongings.", "Outside, the floor supervisor checked the attendance list at the assembly point. One visitor was missing from the initial count, so Layla reported the last known location to the supervisor.", "The visitor had already left for an appointment, and reception confirmed the sign-out record. Staff remained outside until the emergency team gave an official instruction to return.", "At a later debrief meeting, the office improved its visitor procedure. Layla learned that calm communication and accurate information mattered more than guessing what had caused the alarm."],
