      storyTitle: "The Housing Meeting",
      storyTitleArabic: "اجتماع السكان",
      paragraphs: <String>["Residents gathered to discuss a proposed rent increase and repeated heating faults. The tenants committee asked everyone to bring a dated example rather than rely only on general complaints.", "Mona prepared a repair timeline showing when she had reported the problem. The building representative explained the planned maintenance and agreed that earlier messages had not received clear replies.", "The meeting produced a written action list with responsible contacts and target dates. Residents asked for a cost explanation before discussing the proposed increase further.", "A month later, Mona checked which repairs were complete and which still needed attention. The follow-up meeting did not solve every disagreement, but it gave both sides a clearer record of commitments."],
