      grammarTitle: "Reported statements",
      grammarArabic: "في نقل الكلام عن الماضي نستخدم said إن لم نذكر المستمع، وtold مع المستمع. يتغير المضارع غالبًا إلى الماضي، وwill إلى would، مع تعديل الضمائر وفق المتكلم.",
      grammarExamples: <String>["The representative said repairs would begin Monday.", "Mona told the group she had reported the fault.", "Residents said they needed clearer updates."],
      listening: "The residents meeting will begin at seven in the shared hall. Please bring any repair reference numbers and dates that relate to your concern. We will first hear the maintenance update, then discuss the proposed changes to building costs. A written action list will be circulated afterward. If you cannot attend, send your question to the committee before noon so it can be included. The meeting is for recording concerns and agreeing next steps, not replacing individual rental agreements.",
