      title: "A Chance to Start Again",
      titleArabic: "فرصة للبدء من جديد",
      storyTitle: "A Chance to Start Again",
      storyTitleArabic: "فرصة للبدء من جديد",
      paragraphs: <String>["After leaving a course that did not suit her, Yasmin considered a fresh start. A career counselor helped her separate an unsuitable subject from a lack of ability.", "She attended an introductory workshop and built a skills portfolio from small projects. A short placement let her explore a different field without immediately paying for another long course.", "Yasmin made a realistic schedule and discussed the financial commitment with her family. She asked about entry conditions, evening classes, and the support available to returning learners.", "Six months later, she had completed her first module in the new subject. Her progress review showed steady improvement, and she saw the earlier change as a thoughtful decision rather than a permanent failure."],
      storyWords: <EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("fresh start", "بداية جديدة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("career counselor", "مستشار مهني"), EnglishAdvancedWord("unsuitable subject", "تخصص غير مناسب"), EnglishAdvancedWord("introductory workshop", "ورشة تمهيدية"), EnglishAdvancedWord("skills portfolio", "ملف مهارات"), EnglishAdvancedWord("short placement", "تدريب قصير"), EnglishAdvancedWord("different field", "مجال مختلف"), EnglishAdvancedWord("realistic schedule", "جدول واقعي"), EnglishAdvancedWord("financial commitment", "التزام مالي"), EnglishAdvancedWord("entry conditions", "شروط الالتحاق"), EnglishAdvancedWord("returning learners", "متعلمين عائدين"), EnglishAdvancedWord("progress review", "مراجعة التقدم")],
      extraWords: <EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("evening classes", "حصص مسائية"), EnglishAdvancedWord("first module", "الوحدة الدراسية الأولى"), EnglishAdvancedWord("career exploration", "استكشاف مهني"), EnglishAdvancedWord("course change", "تغيير الكورس"), EnglishAdvancedWord("adult learner", "متعلم بالغ"), EnglishAdvancedWord("learning support", "دعم التعلم"), EnglishAdvancedWord("study commitment", "التزام دراسي"), EnglishAdvancedWord("skills assessment", "تقييم مهارات"), EnglishAdvancedWord("introductory course", "كورس تمهيدي"), EnglishAdvancedWord("practice portfolio", "ملف أعمال تدريبية"), EnglishAdvancedWord("education pathway", "مسار تعليمي"), EnglishAdvancedWord("retraining", "إعادة تأهيل مهني"), EnglishAdvancedWord("steady improvement", "تحسن مستمر"), EnglishAdvancedWord("manageable goal", "هدف قابل للتحقيق"), EnglishAdvancedWord("course adviser", "مرشد الكورس"), EnglishAdvancedWord("personal development", "تطور شخصي"), EnglishAdvancedWord("renewed confidence", "ثقة متجددة"), EnglishAdvancedWord("second opportunity", "فرصة ثانية")],
      grammarTitle: "Present perfect and past simple",
      grammarArabic: "نستخدم have أو has مع التصريف الثالث للخبرة دون وقت ماضٍ منتهٍ. نستخدم الماضي البسيط مع yesterday أو last year.",
      grammarExamples: <String>["She has completed her first module.", "She left the old course last year.", "Has she found a suitable subject?"],
      listening: "Our returning learners session is for anyone considering a new course after a break or a change of direction. Bring questions about your available time, previous experience, and the support you might need. You do not have to choose a full programme during the session. Advisers can explain short introductory options and help you compare costs. A small first step can provide useful information before you make a longer commitment, especially when you are exploring an unfamiliar subject.",
      listeningQuestion: "What can advisers help learners do?",
